{"version":1,"content":"<p>英偉達前行政總裁黃仁勳此前曾多次向公司高層保證，他與中國商界女性黃樂（Alice Huang）之間的交往屬於正常商業往來，並沒有不妥之處。與此同時，在《紐約時報》披露兩人關係後，黃仁勳還曾考慮採取法律行動起訴這家美國媒體，但最終並未真正提起訴訟。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586398.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T09:22:49.142965+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T09:06:29+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T09:15:57.907705+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T09:15:57.907705+00:00","content_hash":"84e630305820efca2354adefd29f46a5af87b24f90c52ef42c3266db771ecfde","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}